  "description": "Go farther, faster on the Subvert HT7 Plus with complete Rockshox / SRAM build featuring the new Reba RL 27.5\" Plus fork, SRAM GX 1x11 drivetrain and new SRAM Level T hydraulic disc brakes. Your ride is all-day awesome on easy rolling 27.5 wheels and Plus 3.0 tires. The low weight and no-fuss 1x drivetrain cuts the fat (\"hollah\" if you hate a front derailleur) while still providing a wide 30x11-42T gear range.\n6061-T6 Series alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 12x148mm Boost thru-axle dropouts\nNew RockShox Reba RL 27.5in Plus, 120mm travel, taper alloy steerer, Boost 15x110mm thru-axle, Maxle Stealth axle, w/ remote lockout\nSram GX 1000 24mm X-SYNC 30T crankset\nSram GX shifter\nSram GX 1x11-spd rear derailleur & XG 1150 10-42T cassette\nComplete Ritchey Trail cockpit\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus i40 rims w/ TCS i45 rim tape, Tubeless ready\nWTB Ranger tires, 27.5x3.0\", Dual DNA, TCS, Aramid beads 60 tpi, Tubeless ready\nNew Sram Level T hydraulic disc brakeset",
